              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with an improvised weapon and a crossbow. May have light armour (+2 pts). Light Infantry. Volley Firing. May also be in Combined Formation with Spearmen and Halberdiers. (The Art of War p.108)</characteristic>
