  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="68ba-632c-8db9-673c" name="Han Dynasty (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>HAN DYNASTY (The Art of War, pp.106-108). Special rule: Left Handed Fighting Style (nominated Elite units reduce an opponent's Initiative and saving throw by 1). Military Strategist and Ruses: see Three Kingdoms notes (not built). Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITIONS (pick one in the Army composition list):
[Han Dynasty - Western Han - Army of Internal Suppression]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Chariotry and Cavalry: up to 25%
  Infantry: at least 33%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  WESTERN HAN DYNASTY - ARMY OF INTERNAL SUPPRESSION. Characters up to 25%. Chariotry &amp; Cavalry up to 25%. Infantry at least 33%. Special Units up to 25% (two selected options per 1,000 points).
[Han Dynasty - Western Han - Expeditionary or Route Army]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Chariotry and Cavalry: at least 25%
  Infantry: at least 25%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  WESTERN HAN DYNASTY - EXPEDITIONARY OR ROUTE ARMY. Characters up to 25%. Chariotry &amp; Cavalry at least 25%. Infantry at least 25%. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points). Alternatively may take up to 25% of the points value with Eastern Steppe Nomads as allies (documented only).
[Han Dynasty - Western Han - Army of the Western District (Xi Yu)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Chariotry and Cavalry: at least 25%
  Infantry: at least 25%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  WESTERN HAN DYNASTY - ARMY OF THE WESTERN DISTRICT (XI YU). Characters up to 25%. Chariotry &amp; Cavalry at least 25% (no units of Chariots). Infantry at least 25%. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points). Alternatively may take up to 25% of the points value with Eastern Steppe Nomads as allies (documented only).
[Han Dynasty - Eastern Han - Army of Internal Suppression]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Chariotry and Cavalry: up to 25%
  Infantry: at least 33%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  EASTERN HAN DYNASTY - ARMY OF INTERNAL SUPPRESSION. Characters up to 25%. Chariotry &amp; Cavalry up to 25% (no units of Chariots). Infantry at least 33%. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points). Alternatively may take up to 25% of the points value with Eastern Steppe Nomads as allies (documented only).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
